  "rationale": "Chromatin-focused knockout dropout screen in two KP and two KPK (Keap1-mutant, NRF2-active) mouse LUAD lines, T0 and 14 population doublings (vehicle, 'Ve'), three replicates per line. Columns P1-P4 follow the GSM order KP1, KP2, KPK1, KPK2 (inferred from GSM order and confirmed by correlation of per-line dropout with the deposited MAGeCK-MLE KP and KPK betas). T0 and T1 are paired within line and replicate (pair, 12 levels); time is the common dropout and kpk_t1 (yes only for KPK lines at T1) is the genotype-by-time interaction, i.e. the extra dropout in KPK lines. 24 libraries, 14 coefficients, 10 residual df. Only 36 non-targeting guides, so no control calibration or control null. Genes selectively required in NRF2-active cells (class I HDACs) should be depleted."
}